{"events": [{"tStartMs": 2000, "dDurationMs": 1040, "segs": [{"utf8": "主席先生，", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 3040, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": ">> 大家好。所以，", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 5120, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": ">> 我们在德克萨斯州度过了美好的一天。我们有", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 7680, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "两次大型集会。他们挤满了人。他们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 11360, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "人们在屏幕外观看。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 13440, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们安装了大屏幕", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 15040, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "巨型屏幕或者无论他们怎么称呼，但是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 17760, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们是拥挤的集会和人们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 20480, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "还没有真正见过类似的东西。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 22800, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "这非常令人兴奋。我想我们已经", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 24800, "dDurationMs": 2239, "segs": [{"utf8": "产生了很大的影响。我们看看会发生什么", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 27039, "dDurationMs": 1681, "segs": [{"utf8": "发生在星期二。但我想我们已经", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 28720, "dDurationMs": 2559, "segs": [{"utf8": "产生了很大的影响。非常令人兴奋", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 31279, "dDurationMs": 1601, "segs": [{"utf8": "发生了什么事。我要去", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 32880, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "到俄亥俄州。我将去南方", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 35360, "dDurationMs": 2719, "segs": [{"utf8": "卡罗莱纳.她过得很好。她在一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 38079, "dDurationMs": 4401, "segs": [{"utf8": "民意调查她在哪里。这是达琳。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 42480, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "呃，我认为俄亥俄州的情况也有所好转。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 46160, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以我们做得很好。我们有一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 48079, "dDurationMs": 3361, "segs": [{"utf8": "影响非常大。拉维奥见", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 51440, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "巴尔的摩来到美国。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 53760, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "那是关于什么的？好吧，我会", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 55920, "dDurationMs": 3279, "segs": [{"utf8": "批准。我认为他们都是好人。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 59199, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "这次选举很奇怪", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 62239, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我觉得这太可怕了。这是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 64239, "dDurationMs": 1601, "segs": [{"utf8": "得到了不好的评论。你看什么", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 65840, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "发生在他们的市场上。我会吗", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 68320, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "赞同吗？是的，我会批准它。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 70080, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想这对我来说没问题。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 72560, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "我认为看到它真是太可怕了。我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 74720, "dDurationMs": 2079, "segs": [{"utf8": "没有偏袒任何一方。你知道，我认识他", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 76799, "dDurationMs": 2161, "segs": [{"utf8": "两者都有。我知道", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 78960, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "卢拉。我对拉维奥有一点了解。我知道", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 82000, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "父亲很好。父亲是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 84400, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "我想，待遇真的很糟糕。呃，但是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 87360, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "我没有参与。那是巴西。这是一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 89280, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "不同的国家。我确实参与其中", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 90880, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "一些。我参与了哥伦比亚。我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 93200, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "支持埃尔特，他赢了。他当时排在第10位", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 96159, "dDurationMs": 2241, "segs": [{"utf8": "地方，他赢了，结果他", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 98400, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "成为一位非常强大、非常优秀的总统。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 101680, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "呃，如你所知，在阿根廷，我", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, 